 "remarks": "MUST HAVE EXCELLENT CREDIT. Commuters dream. 1br, 1ba condo located on the 5th floor of Bedford towers with a large balcony overlooking downtown Stamford and overlooking Latham Park across the street. This unit features hardwood floors and a renovated kitchen with newer appliances. Large open floor plan for lots of flexibility. Stroll down Bedford St and enjoy city life at its best. All of your soon-to-be favorite restaurants, movie theatres and shopping are just a few steps away. Close to I95 and the Stamford train station! Heat, hot water, and cooking gas are included. Excellent credit and references are a must.",
